  <style:style style:name="THeadText" style:family="paragraph" style:parent-style-name="Table_20_Heading"><style:text-properties fo:color="#ffffff"/></style:style>
    <style:style style:name="TblWide" style:family="table"><style:table-properties style:width="25.6cm" table:align="margins"/></style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Wide.0" style:family="table-column"><style:table-column-properties style:column-width="3.2cm"/></style:style><style:style style:name="Wide.1" style:family="table-column"><style:table-column-properties style:column-width="3.2cm"/></style:style><style:style style:name="Wide.2" style:family="table-column"><style:table-column-properties style:column-width="3.2cm"/></style:style><style:style style:name="Wide.3" style:family="table-column"><style:table-column-properties style:column-width="3.2cm"/></style:style><style:style style:name="Wide.4" style:family="table-column"><style:table-column-properties style:column-width="3.2cm"/></style:style><style:style style:name="Wide.5" style:family="table-column"><style:table-column-properties style:column-width="3.2cm"/></style:style><style:style style:name="Wide.6" style:family="table-column"><style:table-column-properties style:column-width="3.2cm"/></style:style><style:style style:name="Wide.7" style:family="table-column"><style:table-column-properties style:column-width="3.2cm"/></style:style>
    <style:style style:name="ToLandscape" style:family="paragraph" style:parent-style-name="Heading_20_1" style:master-page-name="Landscape"/>
    <style:style style:name="ToPortrait" style:family="paragraph" style:parent-style-name="Heading_20_1" style:master-page-name="Standard"/></office:automatic-styles>
  <office:master-styles><style:master-page style:name="Standard" style:page-layout-name="pm1"/><style:master-page style:name="Landscape" style:page-layout-name="pm2"/></office:master-styles>
  <office:body><office:text><text:p text:style-name="Title">Rainfall by Station</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">The lighthouse crew mapped the weight of the fishing nets after each trip before the season ended. The harbour office estimated the songs sung at the autumn market for the annual report. The Brindlemoor committee described the weight of the fishing nets after each trip according to the old manual. A small working group measured the height of the hedges along the canal over three consecutive weeks. Each volunteer measured the number of lanterns repaired each winter with remarkable patience. The Brindlemoor committee estimated the condition of the wooden pier despite the persistent fog.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">Each volunteer catalogued the songs sung at the autumn market for the annual report. A small working group estimated the number of lanterns repaired each winter with remarkable patience. The archive keeper mapped the tidal patterns of the northern bay without any modern instruments. The night shift estimated the amount of rain collected in copper gauges over three consecutive weeks. Every visiting student summarised the condition of the wooden pier according to the old manual. The fictional cooperative catalogued the number of lanterns repaired each winter for the annual report.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="ToLandscape">Monthly readings (landscape page)</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">The Brindlemoor committee described the colours of the evening sky over the dunes over three consecutive weeks. The night shift questioned the amount of rain collected in copper gauges using only paper notebooks. The fictional cooperative estimated the songs sung at the autumn market without any modern instruments.</text:p><table:table table:name="Wide" table:style-name="TblWide"><table:table-column table:style-name="Wide.0"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Wide.1"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Wide.2"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Wide.3"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Wide.4"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Wide.5"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Wide.6"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Wide.7"/>
    <table:table-header-rows><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="THead" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="THeadText">Station</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="THead" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="THeadText">Jan</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="THead" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="THeadText">Feb</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="THead" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="THeadText">Mar</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="THead" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="THeadText">Apr</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="THead" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="THeadText">May</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="THead" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="THeadText">Jun</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="THead" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="THeadText">Jul</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row></table:table-header-rows>
